#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:5
#: 7c94425781714549b7c255afb662050d
msgid "Radio Control Calibration"
msgstr "遥控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:7
#: a471f42750b44344b9ce05836fc737b3
msgid ""
"This article shows how to perform radio control calibration using Mission "
"Planner"
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 Mission Planner 进行遥控校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:10
#: 2dd476c5fa0943b18e5d31b7187fa753
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:12
#: e8e3145f9f104fb6ac91d2be9da9dbc2
msgid ""
"RC transmitters allow the pilot to set the flight mode, control the "
"vehicle's movement and orientation and also turn on/off auxiliary functions "
"(i.e. raising and lowering landing gear, etc)."
msgstr "RC 遥控器允许飞手设置飞行模式、控制飞行器的运动和姿态，以及开关辅助功能（如起落架收放等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:14
#: 1fe7acb7a4a840488b548ab52f6d313e
msgid ""
"RC Calibration involves capturing each RC input channel's minimum, maximum "
"and \"trim\" values so that ArduPilot can correctly interpret the input."
msgstr "RC 校准是捕获每个 RC 输入通道的最小值、最大值和「微调」值的过程，以便 ArduPilot 能够正确解读输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:17
#: 2e0a23e0dd2540c5a6904713f61172e4
msgid "Check the Transmitter's Setup"
msgstr "检查遥控器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:19
#: 3bb26eb75f1243b8a0f34c333f780993
msgid ""
"Ensure the battery is disconnected (this is important because it is possible"
" to accidentally arm the vehicle during the RC calibration process)"
msgstr "确保电池已断开（这很重要，因为在 RC 校准过程中可能会意外解锁飞行器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:20
#: 9c116d92e8f345d689bf81ea54994c6a
msgid "Ensure the RC receiver is connected to the autopilot"
msgstr "确保 RC 接收机已连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:21
#: 73032cfa31c24ef18c3670910518c786
msgid ""
"Turn on your RC transmitter and if it has \"trim tabs\" ensure they are in "
"the middle"
msgstr "打开 RC 遥控器，如果有「微调拨片」，确保它们在中间位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:22
#: 3e9486f58b424859a3e36c76ac2f928d
msgid "Connect the autopilot to the PC using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线将飞控连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:23
#: e40a1a0b8a704447a4169fe6c5cff2c1
msgid ""
"On the Mission Planner press the \"Connect\" button and open Mission "
"Planner's **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Radio Calibration** "
"screen"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中按「Connect」按钮，打开 Mission Planner 的 **INITIAL SETUP \\| "
"Mandatory Hardware \\| Radio Calibration** 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:24
#: 48c725a4539447fb97be673e416c7a90
msgid ""
"Some green bars should appear showing the ArduPilot is receiving input from "
"the Transmitter/Receiver. If no bars appear check the receiver's LED:"
msgstr "应出现一些绿色条，表明 ArduPilot 正在接收来自遥控器/接收机的输入。如果没有绿色条，请检查接收机的 LED 指示灯："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:26
#: eedfc06718eb4c57b4f81064933e98ef
msgid ""
"No lights may indicate that it is incorrectly wired to the autopilot.  Look "
"for connectors that may have been inserted upside down"
msgstr "无灯亮可能表示与飞控的接线不正确。检查是否有接线被反向插入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:27
#: 963ae94b8fc14e129fecaddb62832247
msgid ""
"A Red or flashing LED may indicate that your RC transmitter/receiver need be"
" bound.  See the manual that came with your RC equipment for instructions"
msgstr "红灯或闪烁 LED 可能表示 RC 遥控器/接收机需要对频。请参阅 RC 设备随附的说明书"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:32
#: 99be944a0cdb4e01a27c14aacb3819f7
msgid ""
"Check the channel mapping in the transmitter (ie. check which inputs "
"channels are controlled by the transmitter's sticks, switches and knobs) by "
"moving the sticks, knobs and switches and observing which (if any) green "
"bars move.  If this is the first time the transmitter is being used with "
"ArduPilot it is likely that the transmitter's channel mapping will need to "
"be changed and normally this is done on the transmitter itself using its "
"built-in configuration menu"
msgstr ""
"通过移动摇杆、旋钮和开关来检查遥控器中的通道映射（即检查哪些输入通道由遥控器的摇杆、开关和旋钮控制），观察哪些（如果有的话）绿色条移动。如果这是遥控器首次与"
" ArduPilot 配合使用，很可能需要更改遥控器的通道映射，通常在遥控器本身的内置配置菜单中完成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:34
#: d82216351cb442c2ae875737aade8288
msgid "Determine if your transmitter is Mode1 or Mode2 (see below)"
msgstr "确定您的遥控器是 Mode 1 还是 Mode 2（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:35
#: 1c882cfae08e46ca8b61fce52326db8b
msgid "Roll stick should control channel 1"
msgstr "横滚摇杆应控制通道 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:36
#: e6560ea775de4791976f9c0c34c706a4
msgid "Pitch stick should control channel 2"
msgstr "俯仰摇杆应控制通道 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:37
#: 92ce9b600a4e4dba96de3b402471981e
msgid "Throttle stick should control channel 3"
msgstr "油门摇杆应控制通道 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:38
#: 804c5a3b3e9840f18060279a53d15b0d
msgid "Yaw stick should control channel 4"
msgstr "偏航摇杆应控制通道 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:39
#: 363bbd12963b40d3a293a43f193e2113
msgid ""
"A 3 or 6 position switch (to control the flight mode) should be setup to "
"control Channel 5 (default,if using Copter) or Channel 8 (default, if using "
"Rover or Plane).  This channel can be moved by setting the :ref:`FLTMODE_CH "
"<FLTMODE_CH>` parameter in Plane or Copter, or :ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>` in "
"Rover."
msgstr ""
"3 档或 6 档开关（用于控制飞行模式）应设置为控制通道 5（默认，如果使用 Copter）或通道 8（默认，如果使用 Rover 或 "
"Plane）。该通道可通过在 Plane 或 Copter 中设置 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH <FLTMODE_CH>` 参数，或在 Rover"
" 中设置 :ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>` 来更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:40
#: e1cf2a46645749d28b605c1f8c965bc8
msgid "On Copter, a tuning knob should control Channel 6"
msgstr "在 Copter 上，调参旋钮应控制通道 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:41
#: dedbcb5d0eef403e849bff3f8b6381d5
msgid ""
"On Copter and Rover, any remaining two or three position switches can be "
"setup to control auxiliary functions by mapping them to channels 7 to 12"
msgstr "在 Copter 和 Rover 上，其余的两档或三档开关可通过映射到通道 7 至 12 来设置辅助功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:42
#: 943e6b0f2379490ca6231851a3ca64d2
msgid ""
"Note that for reversing motor controls on Plane and Rover, the throttle "
"range is range is normally divided into two parts: - Reverse throttle "
"control: From ``RCx_TRIM`` (typically 1500us) to ``RCx_MIN``, where x is "
"usually \"3\" for normal RC throttle input channel. This corresponds to "
"motor outputs from ``SERVOx_TRIM`` to ``SERVOx_MIN``, where \"x\" is the "
"output controlling the motor, and assumes the ``SERVOx_REVERSE`` bit is not "
"set. - Forward throttle control: From ``RCx_TRIM`` (typically 1500us) to "
"``RCx_MAX``, where x is usually \"3\" for normal RC throttle input channel. "
"This corresponds to motor outputs from ``SERVOx_TRIM`` to ``SERVOx_MAX`, "
"where \"x\" is the output controlling the motor, and assumes the "
"``SERVOx_REVERSE`` bit is not set. Using a spring-loaded stick may be most "
"convenient, as it naturally returns to the neutral (stopped) position at "
"``RCx_TRIM``."
msgstr ""
"请注意，对于 Plane 和 Rover 上的反转电机控制，油门范围通常分为两部分：- 反转油门控制：从 ``RCx_TRIM`` （通常为 "
"1500us）到 ``RCx_MIN``，其中 x 通常是正常 RC 油门输入通道的「3」。这对应于从 ``SERVOx_TRIM`` 到 "
"``SERVOx_MIN`` 的电机输出，其中「x」是控制电机的输出，并假设未设置 ``SERVOx_REVERSE`` 位。- 正转油门控制：从 "
"``RCx_TRIM`` （通常为 1500us）到 ``RCx_MAX``，其中 x 通常是「3」。这对应于从 ``SERVOx_TRIM`` 到 "
"``SERVOx_MAX`` 的电机输出，其中「x」是控制电机的输出，并假设未设置 ``SERVOx_REVERSE`` "
"位。使用弹簧自动回中的摇杆可能最为方便，因为它会自然回到 ``RCx_TRIM`` 处的中立（停止）位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:46
#: c5d70db28afa4c2ba126df351c79386e
msgid ""
"For Plane, it is possible to use an AUX RC switch to provide easie reverse "
"thrust control using the entire throttle stick range on non-sprung throttle "
"sticks. Also, many set up a switch controlled mix in their RC transmitter to"
" map throttle low stick position to output ``RCx_TRIM`` after calibration "
"and either output RC as the stick is raised for reverse or forward operation"
" depending on the TX switch position, giving full throttle stick range to "
"forward or reverse operation."
msgstr ""
"对于 Plane，可以使用辅助 RC 开关，在非弹簧油门摇杆上使用整个油门摇杆范围提供更简便的反推力控制。此外，许多用户在 RC "
"遥控器中设置开关控制的混控，将校准后的油门最低杆位映射到输出 ``RCx_TRIM``，并根据遥控器开关位置在摇杆上抬时输出反转或正转的 RC "
"信号，从而在反转或正转操作中获得完整的油门摇杆范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:48
#: 45b4d41561d54effa6d843a4c5807849
msgid ""
"Move the transmitter's roll, pitch, throttle, and yaw sticks and ensure the "
"green bars move in the correct direction:"
msgstr "移动遥控器的横滚、俯仰、油门和偏航摇杆，确保绿色条向正确方向移动："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:50
#: b0cdaf891681467f9944bb0bc3289163
msgid ""
"For roll, throttle and yaw channels, the green bars should move in the same "
"direction as the transmitter's physical sticks."
msgstr "对于横滚、油门和偏航通道，绿色条应与遥控器物理摇杆的移动方向相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:51
#: 7c95daa864164e25bf16ea986e93f408
msgid ""
"For pitch, the green bar should move in the **opposite** direction to the "
"transmitter's physical stick. **This is not the default for many "
"transmitters.**"
msgstr "对于俯仰，绿色条应与遥控器物理摇杆的移动方向 **相反**。**这对许多遥控器来说并非默认设置。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:52
#: d0772aa27939428cbd42652fc5ef5639
msgid ""
"If one of the green bars moves in the incorrect direction, reverse the "
"channel in the transmitter itself so that logging and outputs etc. are "
"consistent. You may instead reverse the channel in ArduPilot by checking the"
" \"Reversed\" checkbox (if shown), or directly changing the ``RCx_REVERSED``"
" parameter (where \"x\" is the input channel from 1 to 4)."
msgstr ""
"如果某个绿色条向错误方向移动，建议在遥控器本身中反转该通道，以使日志和输出等保持一致。您也可以在 ArduPilot "
"中通过勾选「Reversed」复选框（如果显示）或直接更改 ``RCx_REVERSED`` 参数（其中「x」为 1 至 4 的输入通道）来反转通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:58
#: 909ded993f124b93ab1dbcd861749c02
msgid "Calibration"
msgstr "校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:60
#: 4da737f62c534d8193badc9f68212ffe
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Radio "
"Calibration** screen"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Radio "
"Calibration** 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:61
#: 9e770cc2a57e4106907b5096d20af54a
msgid "Click on the green \"Calibrate Radio\" button on the bottom right"
msgstr "点击右下角的绿色「Calibrate Radio」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:62
#: f16a9bc9a5404a6d8d3dbb8e5c911aa5
msgid ""
"Press \"OK\" when prompted to check the radio control equipment is on, "
"battery is not connected, and propellers are not attached"
msgstr "当提示确认遥控设备已开机、电池未连接、螺旋桨未安装时，按「OK」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:67
#: 2571133fd84a4ce2a46e95048117b2d7
msgid ""
"Move the transmitter's control sticks, knobs and switches to their limits.  "
"Red lines will appear across the calibration bars to show minimum and "
"maximum values seen so far"
msgstr "将遥控器的控制摇杆、旋钮和开关移动到极限位置。红线将出现在校准条上，显示迄今为止检测到的最小值和最大值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:72
#: e00f1c1547214b32adca064becd8aaa7
msgid "Select **Click when Done**"
msgstr "选择 **Click when Done**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:74
#: a7cd26bf77e04d18aa954f858d183a41
msgid ""
"A window will appear with the prompt, \"Ensure all your sticks are centered "
"and throttle is down and click ok to continue\".  Move the throttle to zero "
"and press \"OK\"."
msgstr "将弹出一个窗口，提示「确保所有摇杆居中，油门拨到最低，然后点击确定继续」。将油门移至最低位置，按「OK」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:78
#: 6c43e8bee1d347039d95e0514b942eaf
msgid ""
"Mission Planner will show a summary of the calibration data. Normal values "
"are around 1100 for minimums and 1900 for maximums."
msgstr "Mission Planner 将显示校准数据摘要。正常值约为最小值 1100，最大值 1900。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:83
#: c0d33eb01ac946109c1f05a7be8d5118
msgid ""
"If when testing your throttle stick you notice that the motor turns in a "
"single direction, check in the full parameters list that ``RCx_TRIM`` for "
"the throttle channel is set to the motor controller's neutral value (usually"
" about 1500 us). This should be detected and set automatically during "
"calibration if you followed the procedure without forgetting to **center** "
"your throttle in the last calibration step instead of the normal **low** "
"position."
msgstr ""
"如果测试油门摇杆时发现电机只朝一个方向转动，请在完整参数列表中检查油门通道的 ``RCx_TRIM`` 是否设置为电机控制器的中性值（通常约 1500 "
"us）。如果您按照流程操作，在最后校准步骤中油门居中而非像平时一样拉到最低，这应该会在校准过程中被自动检测并设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:86
#: c84abdda6a4e445c8ca6dd38e8ec3324
msgid "Mode1 and Mode2 Transmitters"
msgstr "Mode 1 和 Mode 2 遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:88
#: 873146fc115645778b8e93431a5932ba
msgid "There are two main transmitter configurations:"
msgstr "有两种主要遥控器配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:90
#: a0f149783c5d4519b47e29e3542f2d64
msgid ""
"*Mode 1*: left stick controls pitch and yaw, the right stick will control "
"throttle and roll."
msgstr "*Mode 1*：左摇杆控制俯仰和偏航，右摇杆控制油门和横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:92
#: ad623bceff9047b0a7a8da95c5e42521
msgid ""
"*Mode 2*: left stick controls throttle and yaw; the right stick will control"
" pitch and roll."
msgstr "*Mode 2*：左摇杆控制油门和偏航，右摇杆控制俯仰和横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:98
#: 7a0966a78154416393bb06400081904f
msgid "There are two alternative configurations:"
msgstr "还有两种替代配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:100
#: ea108dee12fb482982e055de1eea0377
msgid ""
"*Mode 3*: left stick controls pitch and roll, the right stick will control "
"throttle and yaw."
msgstr "*Mode 3*：左摇杆控制俯仰和横滚，右摇杆控制油门和偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:102
#: 083c6cf60d354167a661c0cc2aec3d29
msgid ""
"*Mode 4*: left stick controls throttle and roll; the right stick will "
"control pitch and yaw."
msgstr "*Mode 4*：左摇杆控制油门和横滚，右摇杆控制俯仰和偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:105
#: 3b195e6b366c4bbba0454c27de13ed06
msgid ""
"Mode 3 is the opposite of Mode 2 and Mode 4 is the opposite of Mode 1, "
"giving complete right handed/left handed user options."
msgstr "Mode 3 是 Mode 2 的镜像，Mode 4 是 Mode 1 的镜像，提供了完整的左右手用户选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:110
#: a83d2055830640398e1794b16e90c038
msgid "Channel mappings"
msgstr "通道映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:114
#: 4af404a7a47441458d599f5374cba1a6
msgid "Copter default channel mappings are:"
msgstr "Copter 默认通道映射为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:116
#: c9a0f92a83a74218aa441b17f14e5624
msgid "**Channel 1**: Roll"
msgstr "**通道 1**：横滚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:117
#: f32606cca3854620983cbb1a8e1123a4
msgid "**Channel 2**: Pitch"
msgstr "**通道 2**：俯仰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:118
#: d61108c5bc81478496fc77dc47d5a424
msgid "**Channel 3**: Throttle"
msgstr "**通道 3**：油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:119
#: b19330c6b1414783aa954ccfbb4d2eb6
msgid "**Channel 4**: Yaw"
msgstr "**通道 4**：偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:120
#: d026b9fb12824b7889f95ae73a25cf1d
msgid "**Channel 5**: Flight modes"
msgstr "**通道 5**：飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:121
#: 8f1d29ae6bbc4483bd439b1706830972
msgid ""
"**Channel 6**: (Optional) Inflight tuning or camera mount (mapped to "
"transmitter tuning knob)"
msgstr "**通道 6**：（可选）飞行中调参或相机云台（映射到遥控器调参旋钮）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:122
#: f6f1eee3e85b4dcebd090f8caa38c06c
msgid "**Channel 7 to 12**: (Optional) Auxiliary function switches"
msgstr "**通道 7 至 12**：（可选）辅助功能开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:131
#: a669a35c396c47ed8759c90c890b2c99
msgid "Further Reading"
msgstr "延伸阅读"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:133
#: 461f5f11ca1f44db85ba65c5bd9057c4
msgid ""
"Roll, pitch, throttle and yaw channel mappings can be changed using "
":ref:`RCMAP Input Channel Mapping <common-rcmap>`"
msgstr "横滚、俯仰、油门和偏航通道映射可通过 :ref:`RCMAP 输入通道映射 <common-rcmap>` 进行更改"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:134
#: 5f5b4b474d114036b884edabb7d24ccf
msgid ""
"Flight mode switch setup to specify which vehicle modes are enabled by each "
"switch position can be found on the :ref:`RC Transmitter Flight Mode "
"Configuration <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` page"
msgstr ""
"飞行模式开关设置（指定每个开关位置启用哪些飞行模式）可在 :ref:`RC 遥控器飞行模式配置 <common-rc-transmitter-"
"flight-mode-configuration>` 页面找到"
